ld liquids?", "out": "$choice_a_valid"}, {"type": "assess", "target": "$key_mechanisms", "predicate": "Does this text describe energy transfer through molecular collisions where hot water molecules with higher kinetic energy transfer energy to cold alcohol molecules with lower kinetic energy until the average kinetic energy is the same?", "out": "$choice_b_valid"}, {"type": "assess", "target": "$key_mechanisms", "predicate": "Does this text describe energy transfer through thermal radiation rather than molecular collisions?", "out": "$choice_c_valid"}, {"type": "assess", "target": "$key_mechanisms", "predicate": "Does this text describe energy transfer through molecular collisions where water molecules transfer energy to alcohol molecules until average kinetic energy is the same?", "out": "$choice_d_valid"}], "error_count": 0}
