he firm should decrease capital and increase labor. The question is about what should happen to the marginal products themselves, which is the effect of changing inputs. When we increase labor (and decrease capital), the marginal product of labor should fall (due to diminishing returns) and the marginal product of capital should rise (due to diminishing returns)."}], "error_count": 0}
