riginal 7. So the wavelength increases. Looking at the choices: A says 'Less' and 'varies inversely' - Incorrect, it says less but the relationship is direct. B says 'Greater' and 'varies inversely' - The first part is right (greater), but the second part about 'varies inversely' is wrong. C says 'Greater' and 'varies directly' - Both parts are correct. D says 'Less' and 'varies directly' - First part wrong (less), second part correct (varies directly). The answer is C."}], "error_count": 0}
